<section class="govuk-grid-row" aria-labelledby="glossary-heading">
  <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">
    <h2 id="glossary-heading" class="govuk-heading-l">Glossary</h2>
    <dl class="govuk-summary-list govuk-summary-list--no-border">
      <div class="govuk-summary-list__row">
        <dt class="govuk-summary-list__key">Criminal Record</dt>
        <dd class="govuk-summary-list__value">Permanent record of illegal activity created by delivering illicit cargo. Cleared only on arrest. Shows as [C] tag on your name.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="govuk-summary-list__row">
        <dt class="govuk-summary-list__key">Wanted Status</dt>
        <dd class="govuk-summary-list__value">Temporary police attention shown as asterisk stars (*) in your player tag. Expires over time (5 minutes if avoiding police). Star level (1–5) indicates severity based on remaining heat.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="govuk-summary-list__row">
        <dt class="govuk-summary-list__key">Confiscation</dt>
        <dd class="govuk-summary-list__value">Money taken from you on arrest. Includes Wanted bounty + Criminal Record confiscatable amount. Given to arresting officer as reward.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="govuk-summary-list__row">
        <dt class="govuk-summary-list__key">[C] Tag</dt>
        <dd class="govuk-summary-list__value">Visual indicator in your name showing you have an active Criminal Record. Format: <code>[C1]</code>, <code>[C2]</code>, etc. Only removed on arrest.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="govuk-summary-list__row">
        <dt class="govuk-summary-list__key">[*] Tag</dt>
        <dd class="govuk-summary-list__value">Visual indicator showing Wanted status. One to five asterisks based on remaining heat. Appears between police level and criminal level: <code>[P1*****C1] Name</code>.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="govuk-summary-list__row">
        <dt class="govuk-summary-list__key">Arrest Zone</dt>
        <dd class="govuk-summary-list__value">Designated geographic area where police can initiate arrests. If no zones exist, arrests can occur anywhere.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="govuk-summary-list__row">
        <dt class="govuk-summary-list__key">Heat</dt>
        <dd class="govuk-summary-list__value">Numerical value (0–300) representing your Wanted status severity. Decreases over time when avoiding police. Determines star level in your tag.</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

